    {
      "id": 24,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Where per-seller money & payout state lives",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 57
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Seller earnings & payout state are NOT on this dashboard\nEarnings, held obligations, transfer status and payout state are per-seller (high-cardinality) financial data. They live in **Postgres** (the durable ledger) and are surfaced on the **Stripe & Settlement** dashboard (`uid: petabyte-settlement`), driven by `settlement.*` / `seller.transfer.created` events split by `payment_mode`. Query one seller's detail from **Loki / the DB** by `seller_id` — never as a Prometheus label:\n\n```logql\n{service=\"petabyte-api\"} | json | seller_id=\"<SELLER_ID>\"\n```\n\nSee `docs/SELLER_OBSERVABILITY.md`, `docs/OBSERVABILITY_DATA_DICTIONARY.md`, and `docs/runbooks/SELLER_AGENT_OFFLINE.md`."
      },
      "datasource": null
    }
